  "method": "Read the current club website and the public LiveCaddie 649 guide; inspect all 18 served schematic images and locate their explicitly coloured tee symbols. Compare source dates and scorecard conflicts. No scorecard-distance fitting, schematic georeferencing or nearest-pad inference was used.",
  "coordinateReferenceSystem": null,
  "officialTeeCoordinatesFound": false,
  "geographicPadAssignments": [],
  "findings": [
    "The current official club homepage links to LiveCaddie course 649.",
    "All 18 served LiveCaddie graphics contain explicit white, yellow, blue, red and orange symbols. Orange is drawn on or at the fairway start in every hole; it is not shown on a separate raised platform.",
    "Image Last-Modified headers are 2024-05-21; this is an asset upload/modification time, not a surveyed geometry date or imagery capture date.",
    "All underlying LiveCaddie hole records expose DateTime 2020-06-23 01:07:11 and revision 3. Hole 1 still exposes white 355 m and yellow 336 m, while the current club-linked Scorekort-2023.pdf and repository card use white 386 m and yellow 350 m.",
    "The public LiveCaddie graphics/trackermap pages did not expose official per-colour geographic tee coordinates. Schematic image pixels below are not WGS84, EPSG:3006 or model coordinates.",
    "The current Caddee page identifies Angso as not affiliated and uses Quick Design. Its hole 1 HTML gives white 396 m, whereas the linked raster itself prints white 365 m, yellow 345 m, blue 320 m and red 295 m. These inconsistencies prevent treating Caddee as a current authoritative coordinate source."
  ],
